\section{The original contour and the all-branch region}
\label{sec:K}

The original lower support needs a different estimate from the selected
contour. We first build a partition whose support survives every cutoff
derivative. Complete pair factors then provide Gaussian decay in the
particle number. For the remaining intermediate orders, the all-branch
region is divided into a small nonresonant core and its complement.
